chevron-down, chevron-left, chevron-right, close, eye, eye-off, history,
logout, menu, message, more, plus, search, send, shield, ticket, user and
users) are drawn from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), adapted to the stroke width
of the design system. Lucide is distributed under the following licence:

